  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/uURVp8x.png\" alt=\"Knaves&#x27; Needs - Simply Swords 附属模组\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/tTghqaB.png\" alt=\"包含超过 520 种额外武器及其专属特效。完全支持 Better Combat。\" width=\"1152\" height=\"648\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/GMJNUUb.png\" alt=\"需要 Simply Swords\" width=\"1152\" height=\"156\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/9eovfuJ.png\" alt=\"需要 Architectury\" width=\"1152\" height=\"156\"></a></strong></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/btBnBWk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1152\" height=\"156\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><em>“每位恶棍所需的一切。”——史蒂夫·我的世界</em></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>必需模组</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords</a>（必需）[FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a>&nbsp;[FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">ClothConfig</span></strong></a> [FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可选 - 支持模组</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Better</span> Combat</a>&nbsp;<strong>（强烈推荐）&nbsp;</strong>[FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbidden &amp;</a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-arcanus\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Arcanus</a>&nbsp;[FORGE - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a> [FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-undergarden\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Undergarden</a> [FORGE - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blue-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blue Skies</a>&nbsp;[FORGE - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plus-the-end\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plus The End</a>&nbsp;[FORGE - 1.18]&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a>&nbsp;[FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a>&nbsp;[FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mariums-soulslike-weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Marium's Soulslike Weaponry</a>&nbsp;[FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper And Darker</a> [FORGE/FABRIC - 1.19]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a> [FORGE/FABRIC - 1.18 -&gt; 1.20]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-imbuement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amethyst Imbuement</a> [FABRIC 1.20]</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">-Fabric 版请使用 Oh The Biomes You'll Go Refabricated</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>已知问题</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>我将修复的问题：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>火焰武器目前尚未添加动画效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>超出我处理范围的问题：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>修复与基础模组的轻微双持兼容问题。（如 The Undergarden、Blue Skies 等。）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;这需要修改对应模组的源代码。</p>\n&nbsp;</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>常见问题</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>问：会支持 X 模组吗？</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 答：</strong>可能会。欢迎在评论区提出支持请求，但无法保证一定会添加。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>问：在哪里报告问题或建议新功能？</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>答：</strong>就在这里提问是最理想的。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;鸣 谢</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>本模组的制作离不开以下杰出人士的帮助与支持。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Konsyliarz42</strong> - <em>制作了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimply-swords-vanilla-style\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords - Vanilla Style</a> 资源包，作为本模组纹理的基础与参考。</em></li>\n<li><strong>Sweenuss/Sweeney</strong> - <em>Simply Swords 的作者，没有他们的支持就没有本模组。</em></li>\n<li><strong>Chronos_Sacaria</strong> - Timefall Development 联合创始人（负责 MCDW 等模组），在代码重构方面提供了巨大帮助。</li>\n<li><strong>Daedelus</strong> - <em>Better Combat 的作者，协助添加了对其模组的支持。（他们非常棒，请给他们点个赞。）</em></li>\n<li><strong>LostLandFound</strong> - <em>艺术家、测试员兼好友。本模组能存在得益于他们努力适配 Konsyliarz 的纹理。</em></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/fzzyhmstrs/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">fzzyhmstrs</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 社区的优秀成员。<em>（去看看他们的作品吧。）</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/phantomprogrammer/\" rel=\"nofollow\">PhantomProgrammer</a> - 艺术家。制作了支持 Oh The Biomes You'll Go 和 Deeper And Darker 的纹理。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>免责声明</strong> - <em>尽管本模组是 Simply Swords 的附属模组，但与 Simply Swords 或 Timefall Development 并无关联。我不声称拥有 Simply Swords 的任何原始内容。本模组展示的所有纹理和模型均为独立内容。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
